{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14030","headline":"春日书情寄元校书伯和相国元子 · 耿湋","name":"春日书情寄元校书伯和相国元子","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"数岁平津邸，诸生出门时。\n羇孤力行早，疎贱托身迟。\n芳草看无厌，青山到未期。\n贫居悲老大，春日上茅茨。\n卫玠琼瑶色，玄成鼎鼐姿。\n友朋汉相府，兄弟谢家诗。\n律合声虽应，劳歌调自悲。\n流年不可住，惆怅镜中丝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"耿湋","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14030.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14030","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}